<title>SPAIN: Spain says 6.5 pct investment 97 rise &quot;moderate&quot;.</title>
<headline>Spain says 6.5 pct investment 97 rise &quot;moderate&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Economy Secretary Cristobal Montoro said on Friday the 6.5 percent forecast for 1997 gross capital formation was &quot;moderate&quot; compared to the 4.9 percent forecast for this year.</p>
<p>Montoro, speaking at a news conference after the Spanish cabinet approved the 1997 budget draft, said this increase in investment will stem principally from private consumption, greater financial efficiency of companies and costs savings.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
